 # Dimensional reduction plot
 
+Here, we used the `sc_dim` of `ggsc` package to visualize the result if `TSNE`, unlike other packages to visualize the results, `ggsc` also provides `sc_dim_geom_label` to visualize the cell cluster labels, which can work with `geom_shadowtext` of `shadowtext` and `geom_text` of `ggplot2` (default) by specifying the `geom` argument.
+
+
 ```{r setup}
 library(ggsc)
 library(ggplot2)
